  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RCRC Movement and universal health coverage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghen Red Cross/Crescent health/care programmes to reduce morbidity and mortality. Support communities to be healthier and safer. Development of policies, guidelines, tools and training materials, evaluation and monitoring systems, innovation. Improving  health outcomes for women and children. Advocacy, social mobilization and safe motherhood. Reducing major health inequalities.</narrative>
  </description>
